<title>USA: Fed says weekend system RPs totaled $977 million. [CORRECTED 16:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Fed says weekend system RPs totaled $977 million. [CORRECTED 16:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to read &quot;$977 million&quot; rather than &quot;$977 billion&quot;)</p>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $977 million in temporary reserves to the banking system in its over-the-weekend system repurchase operation on Friday, a New York Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1867 ))</p>
